# Khadija Zaman

> SEO and AI search (GEO/AEO) lead, in-house at Wellows, based in Karachi, Pakistan. Gets brands found on Google and cited inside AI answer engines (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Claude, Google AI Overviews) using semantic SEO, content strategy and marketing automation run as one system.

Khadija Zaman is an SEO and AI search (GEO/AEO) lead based in Karachi, Pakistan. She has worked in search since 2019, in agency and in-house roles, and since 2023 has owned the SEO, content and AI-search programs at Wellows, a B2B SaaS company, where her formal title is Marketing Manager. At Wellows, LLM referral sessions grew from a 176-a-month baseline to 9× in 8 months (July 2025 to February 2026) and 22× at 12 months (GA4), with zero paid spend, and Google Search Console impressions grew from 680K to 3.78M. She built three SEO tools at Wellows grounded in Google patent research (Query Fan-Out Generator, LLM Query Builder, AI Humanizer), used by 1,647 practitioners across the UK, US and EU and acquired entirely through organic search. In 2026 she rebuilt her own published cross-engine AI citation study, ran it against a permutation null, and retracted two headline findings that did not hold.

This site covers her case studies, CV, free SEO/AEO tools, and writing on how modern search visibility works across both traditional search engines and AI answer engines.

